OL,3,A'You've had a wonderful life Tommy, but
OL,4,Ait's over' - Sir Tom feared he was
OL,5,Adying
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Tom Jones has told fans he feared
OL,8,Fhis life was "over" after being
OL,9,Fadmitted to hospital in the US with
OL,10,Fflu.
OL,12,FThe 86-year-old from Pontypridd spent a
OL,13,Fweek at the Ronald Regan UCLA Medical
OL,14,FCenter in Los Angeles and was forced to
OL,15,Fcancel or reschedule a number of
OL,16,Fconcerts.
OL,18,FBut on Wednesday night, he was back on
OL,19,Fstage at the Greek Theatre and told the
OL,20,Faudience just how serious his "bad case
OL,21,Fof the flu" was.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
